Error: Jet.UnknownName: Nothing named `ŝelf` exists here
  --> Tests/UI/dead_key_circumflex_self_window.jet:8:15
    |
  8 |         edit: ŝelf.counts[0]
    |               ^^^^
 Why: On a keyboard layout where `^` is a dead key, `^` and the letter after it combine into one accented letter, so `^self` was typed as `ŝelf`
 Fix: Write `^self`; on a dead-key layout type `^` then a space, or switch to the layout's no-dead-keys variant
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.UnknownName
